{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15130","headline":"与王楚同登青龙寺上方 · 李益","name":"与王楚同登青龙寺上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连冈出古寺，流睇移芳讌。\n鸟没汉诸陵，草平秦故殿。\n摇光浅深树，拂木参差燕。\n春心断易迷，远目伤难徧。\n壮日各轻年，暮年方自见。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15130.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15130","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}